  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Filter the Indonesian BMKG/USGS earthquake catalog by time, magnitude, depth, region, coastline distance and map box, look at the epicenters on a fault/trench map and as hypocenters against Slab2 slab surfaces, review precomputed PSHA hazard maps and curves, and export the event table and a print-ready map sheet. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
